<title>USA: MediaConcepts president resigns.</title>
<headline>MediaConcepts president resigns.</headline>
<dateline>PALM SPRINGS, Calif. 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Paul Andre said Monday he has resigned as president of MediaConcepts Inc over disagreements with management about the way the company was being run.</p>
<p>Andre said in a brief statement Sandra Andre also resigned as treasurer.</p>
<p>MediaConcepts was not immediately available for comment.</p>
</text>
